<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Chennai to Madurai | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does bike transport from Chennai to Madurai usually take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad guarantees delivery within 24‑48 hours door‑to‑door for a Chennai‑to‑Madurai bike parcel. The 850 km journey on NH 16 is optimized with dedicated routes, live GPS monitoring, and priority loading, ensuring that most shipments arrive well within the two‑day window, even with minor traffic variations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my bike fully insured during the Chennai‑Madurai move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every bike transported from Chennai to Madurai is covered by 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects the declared value of your two‑wheeler against loss, theft, or accidental damage, and claims are processed within 48 hours of delivery confirmation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What packing materials are used to protect my bike?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our signature 7‑layer system includes 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for delicate components. Each layer is applied by trained technicians to absorb shocks, prevent scratches, and guard against moisture throughout the Chennai‑Madurai transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All Shree Ashirwad hydraulic‑ramp trailers are equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location updates to our customer portal. You receive instant notifications at key milestones—loading, departure, en‑route checkpoints, and arrival—so you can monitor your bike’s journey from Chennai to Madurai at any time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book a bike parcel service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To book a Chennai‑to‑Madurai bike transport, you need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a recent photograph of the bike, and a signed e‑Way bill for interstate movement. These documents enable smooth customs clearance, GST invoicing, and eligibility for corporate reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on bike models or sizes for this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad can handle most standard two‑wheelers, including sports bikes, cruisers, and scooters, up to 250 kg GVW. Oversized or heavily modified bikes may require a custom container, which we arrange at no extra cost. Our hydraulic ramp trailers have adjustable clamps to secure any bike safely on the Chennai‑Madurai corridor.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the instant quote generated and is it binding?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The instant quote engine uses the pickup address, bike make/model, and preferred moving date to calculate distance‑based fare, fuel surcharge, GST, and insurance premium. The generated price is locked for 48 hours, giving you a reliable, binding estimate for your Chennai‑to‑Madurai bike transport before you confirm the booking.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
